    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk, a \"brief connection\" sounds exhausting. everything feels so pointless when you're just waiting for a life that never actually starts. it feels like i'm just taking up space that someone else could actually use. like, why even keep pushing if the world just works better without me in it?",
